# Secrets & Env

- Store secrets only in `.env` (gitignored). Use `.env.example` for names only.
- Never print, commit, or paste API keys / app secrets into chat, PRs, or memory MDs.
- Ask the user for missing keys at the wiring gate; do not hardcode placeholders that pretend to work.
- Rotate any key that appeared in chat history.
- Client-safe vars only use `VITE_` prefix.
